            <h2>Before &amp; After: Key Redesign Decisions</h2>

            <h3>Setup: Live Captions &rarr; Communication Assist</h3>
            <p>User testing showed separate setup steps for captions, translation, and language selection felt overwhelming before a call. We consolidated Live Caption, Translation, and Text-to-Speech into a single &ldquo;Communication Assist&rdquo; sheet with auto language detection.</p>
